B.Zg=s(["Even a short pause can help your eyes settle.","A few seconds away can make returning feel lighter.","It takes little time, but your eyes may feel better.","A small pause can ease the feeling of eye strain.","Less than a minute can trade for less tired eyes.","Short breaks help your eyes stop pushing for too long.","Pause briefly so your eyes have time to recover.","A tiny reset can help your work feel lighter.","You do not need a long break to care for your eyes.","When your eyes rest early, your body feels lighter too.","Slowing down a little can soften your work rhythm.","Resting before you are exhausted is easier than recovering after.","A gentle minute can help dry, tense eyes feel calmer.","A short eye break helps you return to the screen clearer.","Pausing at the right time keeps strain from building too long.","A small reset is one way to save energy for the day.","It does not need to be long, just steady and on time.","Calmer eyes can make screen work easier to keep.","A few seconds off screen gives your eyes breathing room.","Resting early can prevent heavy eyes later.","A small pause helps the muscles around your eyes and face soften.","Caring for your eyes bit by bit is easier than waiting until tired."],t.s)
B.a9Q=s(["Relax your eyes and take one slow breath.","Gently close your eyes, breathe in, then exhale slowly.","Look away from the screen and let your shoulders soften.","Blink fully a few times, then relax your face.","Move your eyes away from the screen for a few seconds.","Send your gaze farther out without trying to focus.","Breathe in gently, then let the exhale run a little longer.","Release your jaw, drop your shoulders, and let your eyes rest.","Close your eyes and notice your breath.","Look toward a point farther than your screen.","Let your eyes soften; there is nothing else to do.","Stay still for one beat, then exhale slowly.","Rest your gaze far away and let your breathing slow down.","Close your eyes for a few seconds and relax your forehead.","Blink very slowly before returning to the screen.","Look through a window or toward a distant point in the room.","Let your shoulders drop and your eyes loosen.","Breathe in smoothly, then breathe out slow and long.","Let your gaze rest on something far away.","Close your eyes as if turning the screen off for a moment.","Loosen your face, jaw, and the area around your eyes.","Keep your gaze far away for one more beat."],t.s)
B.a9p=s(["Look away from the screen","Rest on a distant point","Blink before returning"],t.s)
B.a7C=s(["Relax your face","Blink fully and slowly","Let your eyes rest"],t.s)
B.a8e=s(["Close your eyes lightly","Relax face and shoulders","Open slowly when cued"],t.s)
B.a9U=s(["Look at a distant point","Keep your gaze off screen","Blink before returning"],t.s)
B.Zd=s(["Turn away from the screen","Look across the room","Let shoulders drop"],t.s)
B.a4A=s(["Reduce glare if needed","Keep screen at arm length","Make text comfortable"],t.s)
B.a7w=s(["Release your jaw","Drop your shoulders","Keep your gaze off screen"],t.s)
B.a1l=s([u.FH,u.tA,u.zf],t.s)
B.a9t=s(["Check for window or lamp reflections on the screen.",u.jK,u.AB],t.s)
